<view class="page-shell history-page">
  <view class="history-header"><text class="eyebrow">STEP 05 / HISTORY</text><text class="page-title">历史记录</text><text class="page-intro">固定演示账号的训练会话都会保存在这里。</text></view>
  <view class="history-tip"><text>状态说明：</text><text>进行中可续练，已完成可查看报告，已放弃记录仅用于回看。</text></view>
  <view class="empty-history card" wx:if="{{sessions.length === 0}}"><text class="empty-icon">↺</text><text class="empty-title">还没有训练记录</text><text class="empty-text">完成一次训练后，报告和完整对话会自动出现在这里。</text></view>
  <view class="history-list" wx:else>
    <view class="history-card card" wx:for="{{sessions}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="history-card-top"><text class="history-scene">{{item.scenarioName}}</text><text class="status {{item.statusClass}}">{{item.statusText}}</text></view>
      <view class="history-meta"><text>{{item.updatedAt}}</text><text>{{item.currentRound}} / {{item.maxRounds}} 轮</text><text wx:if="{{item.evaluation}}">{{item.evaluation.totalScore}} 分</text><text wx:else>未评分</text></view>
      <view class="history-actions"><text class="conversation-link" bindtap="toggleConversation" data-id="{{item.id}}">{{expandedId === item.id ? '收起对话' : '查看完整对话'}} ›</text><button class="history-button {{item.statusClass}}" bindtap="handleAction" data-id="{{item.id}}">{{item.actionText}}</button></view>
      <view class="conversation" wx:if="{{expandedId === item.id}}"><view class="conversation-row {{message.role === 'user' ? 'mine' : ''}}" wx:for="{{item.messages}}" wx:for-item="message" wx:key="id"><text class="conversation-role">{{message.role === 'user' ? '客服' : '患者'}}</text><text class="conversation-text">{{message.content}}</text></view></view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <text class="disclaimer">完整对话仅保存在当前演示环境，不包含真实患者信息。</text>
</view>
